      "refersTo": "counter-panel-head",
      "description": "Suggested-question group with sign-green head.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-panel\"><div class=\"ds-panel-head\"><b>1</b>법률 상담</div><button class=\"ds-row\">전세 보증금을 돌려받지 못하면 어떻게 해야 하나요?</button><button class=\"ds-row\">층간소음 분쟁 해결 방법과 관련 법률은?</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{width:340px;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(205,213,209,.9),0 6px 18px -8px rgba(18,26,23,.18)}.ds-panel-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 14px;background:#0E3B34;color:#F0F6F3;font:700 15px 'Gothic A1',sans-serif}.ds-panel-head b{display:grid;place-items:center;width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:3px;background:#F0F6F3;color:#0E3B34;font-weight:800}.ds-row{display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;padding:12px 14px;border:0;border-top:1px solid #CDD5D1;background:#fff;color:#121A17;font:400 15px 'Noto Sans KR',sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-row:first-of-type{border-top:0}.ds-row:hover{background:#F4F7F5}.ds-row:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #1D5FD1;outline-offset:-2px}"
